<div class="character-importer">
    <div class="odo-connection">
        {{#if connected}}
            <p class="odo-connected">{{#if accountName}}{{localize "olddragon2e.odo_connected_as" name=accountName}}{{else}}{{localize "olddragon2e.odo_connected_generic"}}{{/if}}
                <button type="button" class="button odo-disconnect-button">{{localize "olddragon2e.odo_disconnect"}}</button>
            </p>
        {{else}}
            <button type="button" class="button odo-connect-button"><i class="fa-solid fa-link"></i>{{localize "olddragon2e.odo_connect"}}</button>
            <p class="odo-consent">{{localize "olddragon2e.odo_consent_intro"}}</p>
            <ul class="odo-consent-list">
                <li>{{localize "olddragon2e.odo_consent_permissions"}}</li>
                <li>{{localize "olddragon2e.odo_consent_per_browser"}}</li>
                <li>{{localize "olddragon2e.odo_consent_revoke"}}</li>
            </ul>
        {{/if}}
    </div>
    <hr>
    <p>Insira o link da página da ficha do <strong>ajudante</strong> ou <strong>personagem</strong> escolhido no <a href="{{odoBaseUrl}}">ODO</a>.</p>
    <p>Utilize o botão “Compartilhar”, ou copie a URL no browser.</p>
    <input name="character-importer" id="character-importer-url-text" type="text">{{character-importer}}</input>
    <div class="button-row">
        <button type="submit" class="button character-importer-button" name="character-importer" value="1"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-import"></i>{{localize "olddragon2e.import"}}</button>
        <button type="submit" class="button cancel-button" name="cancel" value="1"><i class='fa-solid fa-xmark'></i>{{localize "olddragon2e.cancel"}}</button>
    </div>
</div>
